# Atlas managed edge routes — loaded by /opt/atlas/edge/watch.py.
(atlas_tls) {
 tls {
  issuer acme {
   dir https://acme-v02.api.letsencrypt.org/directory
   email ishakovzakir0@gmail.com
  }
 }
}
www.atlasmarket.uz {
 import atlas_tls
 redir https://atlasmarket.uz{uri} permanent
}
atlasmarket.uz {
 import atlas_tls
 encode zstd gzip
 request_body {
  max_size 10MB
 }
 reverse_proxy atlas-web:3000 {
  header_up Host atlasmarket.uz
  header_up X-Forwarded-Host atlasmarket.uz
  header_up X-Forwarded-Proto https
  header_up CF-Connecting-IP {remote_host}
 }
 header -Server
}
